Mapping from sample:
- line_item.id -> shopify_line_item_id
- parent order id -> order_id
- line_item.product_id -> shopify_product_id
- line_item.variant_id -> shopify_variant_id
- match local products table by Shopify product/variant ID if available -> product_id
- line_item.sku -> sku
- line_item.vendor -> vendor
- line_item.title -> title
- line_item.variant_title -> variant_title
- line_item.quantity -> quantity
- line_item.current_quantity -> current_quantity
- line_item.price -> unit_price
- line_item.total_discount -> total_discount
- line_item.grams -> grams
- line_item.requires_shipping -> requires_shipping
- line_item.fulfillment_status -> fulfillment_status

Sync strategy:
Use MAX(orders.shopify_updated_at) to determine incremental sync point.

Example:
SELECT MAX(shopify_updated_at) FROM orders;

Then request Shopify orders using updated_at_min from that timestamp.

Required behaviour:
1. Upsert customers by shopify_customer_id.
2. Upsert customer default address by shopify_address_id.
3. Upsert orders by shopify_order_id.
4. Upsert order_items by shopify_line_item_id.
5. Preserve historical order prices even if product price changes later.
6. Store Shopify timestamps correctly.
7. Store money fields as decimal, not float.
8. Link order_items.product_id to local products where possible.
9. If no local product match exists, keep product_id null.
10. Do not store browser_ip, checkout_token, cart_token, order_status_url, latitude, longitude.

Recommended indexes:
customers:
- shopify_customer_id
- email

customer_addresses:
- customer_id
- shopify_address_id

orders:
- shopify_order_id
- customer_id
- processed_at
- financial_status
- shopify_updated_at

order_items:
- order_id
- product_id
- shopify_product_id
- shopify_variant_id
- sku

Investigation output required before coding:
- existing files related to Shopify sync
- current product table Shopify identifiers
- existing migration style
- proposed migration file(s)
- affected API/service files
- risks
- test plan
- estimated complexity

Testing requirements:
Add tests for:
- customer mapping
- address mapping
- order mapping
- order item mapping
- duplicate upsert prevention
- incremental sync based on MAX(shopify_updated_at)
- missing customer
- missing local product match
- cancelled order
- discounted order
- decimal money handling

Validation commands:
Run relevant project commands, likely:
- pnpm lint
- pnpm typecheck
- pnpm test
- filtered turbo commands if this is a Turborepo package

PR checklist:
- DB migration included
- No unnecessary PII stored
- Money fields use decimal
- Upserts are idempotent
- Order items link to local products where possible
- Tests added
- README/dev notes updated if needed